    </MiriamAnnotation>
    <Comment>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <h2>Model of yeast translation</h2>
  <p>(mRNA length = 75, ribosome occupancy = 15)</p>
  <p>Based on a previous model by Juergen Pahle, Shichina Kannambath and Pedro Mendes, published in  Firczuk H, Kannambath S, Pahle J, Claydon A, Beynon R, Duncan J, Westerhoff H, Mendes P, McCarthy JEG (2013) An in vivo control map for the eukaryotic mRNA translation machinery. <i>Molecular Systems Biology</i> <b>9</b>:635</p>
  <p>Differs from 2013 model by having R2, R13, R15, R21, and R25 irreversible.</p>
  <p>Generated by the Perl script "translationModel_uM.pl" version 9 (juergen@pahle.de, pmendes@uchc.edu).</p>
      </body>
    </Comment>
